# Files that must never ship in the published tarball.
#
# The `files` allowlist in package.json already covers the intended surface,
# but npm still packs some dot-entries and generated artifacts that live under
# an allowlisted directory. .archlint-cache/ is archlint's own cache: it is
# regenerated on every run, it grows without bound, and its two files
# (git-history.redb, cache.bin) accounted for 2.16 MB of a 2.88 MB tarball —
# enough to trip the 2 MB size guard in Cross-Platform CI.
.archlint-cache/
*.redb
*.bin

# Editor and OS scratch files.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
